<title>GERMANY: Germany allots 4.87 bln dmk 30-year Bund at 99.81.</title>
<headline>Germany allots 4.87 bln dmk 30-year Bund at 99.81.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Wednesday that it had allotted 4.871 billion marks of the German government's 6.50 percent coupon 30-year Bund at a lowest accepted price of 99.81.</p>
<p>The central bank, acting as issuing agent for the government, said it received offers for 9.184 billion marks of the new paper at an average price of 99.78.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
